cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use slopestab in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "slopestab: 2D slope stability analysis by limit equilibrium methods"
abstract: >-
  A numpy-only Python library implementing Fellenius, Bishop, Janbu, Spencer and
  Morgenstern-Price limit-equilibrium analyses, circular slip-surface search,
  infinite-slope and planar-wedge checks, verified against the ACADS benchmark.
authors:
  - family-names: Li
    given-names: Shangru
    affiliation: Chengdu Jincheng College
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-26"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/lizhengyang-byte/slopestab"
type: software
keywords:
  - slope stability
  - limit equilibrium
  - geotechnical engineering
  - factor of safety
